{"game": "back-4-blood", "language": "english", "appid": 924970, "month": "2025-10", "window": 2, "start_date": 1759968000, "end_date": 1760572799, "month_true_total": 251, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 20:54:05 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "206816071", "author": {"steamid": "76561198048427161", "personaname": "Jean Chretien", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/jeanchretien/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 694, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 440, "last_played": 1760688321, "avatar": "60f3cbd5f10152aa406976320abb34e1bfae969f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Get it on a good sale, it's fun with a friend.\nIgnore the negative reviews and give it an honest play. I enjoyed left 4 dead and I enjoy this game too, while it doesn't have the same charm as left 4 dead its still a good game in its own way. It is a most worthy co op game to play with a few buddies.", "timestamp_created": 1760567716, "timestamp_updated": 1760567716, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "206778868", "author": {"steamid": "76561198133265702", "personaname": "Munchkin", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/munchjohn/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 37, "playtime_forever": 791, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 572, "last_played": 1760819063, "avatar": "e1696ab0539e8a17cff4d5bd195a9d53bdbc2710"}, "language": "english", "review": "I thought the game was going to be bad and worse than Left 4 Dead 2. I was surprised that it wasn't. Everything in this game has been really cool. The story is a bit meh but the missions and the characters being unique and having abilities that only helps themselves but the team as well, it's sick. I like this game a lot. Of course, the price tag is too expensive so wait for a sale.", "timestamp_created": 1760531747, "timestamp_updated": 1760531747, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "206775502", "author": {"steamid": "76561199072374783", "personaname": "Paris", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199072374783/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 8530, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5562, "last_played": 1778478622, "avatar": "cde80f50ba4fa74abbd3f7b2b44354ef8e3b1685"}, "language": "english", "review": "yes", "timestamp_created": 1760527584, "timestamp_updated": 1760527584, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "206772584", "author": {"steamid": "76561198447105767", "personaname": "FRAM REX", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/FRAM-REX/", "num_games_owned": 106, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 1275, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 821, "last_played": 1762198354, "avatar": "aee31d06cd9c4ce7453237af0cf339794f2abc90"}, "language": "english", "review": "nice game", "timestamp_created": 1760523371, "timestamp_updated": 1760523371, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.54356849193572998", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "206769556", "author": {"steamid": "76561198155871004", "personaname": "Kara_Pabuc", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Kara_Pabuc/", "num_games_owned": 239, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 215, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 215, "last_played": 1760517923, "avatar": "12468e974f4bc0b0a60b17c7e2734926af78fb90"}, "language": "english", "review": "I tried to get in to this game several times on several different platforms. It just doesn't click... The card/deck system is unnecessarily bloated, confusing and boring and has no place in a game such as this. Despite the fact that this game made a decade after the L4D, devs absolutely refused anything to add to the formula. There's absolutely nothing in terms of gameplay that differs from L4D. No slide, no dodge, no nothing. \r\n\r\nIt's Temu L4D with a terrible decks system. Incredibly disappointing game.", "timestamp_created": 1760518229, "timestamp_updated": 1760518229, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.45815625786781311", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}]}